    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-168acd49-6c9e-4047-80bc-0e752af1ac55",
      "chapter_id": "ch-42c2f6c6-57b6-4e91-9994-b1f07d9bde6b",
      "chapter_number": 7,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "航图被固定在雾线水门外的锚柱上，右下角缺失了一块。",
      "sha256": "1e159e7c5a5225268aab364e95e0926700e43c30781b7eaa0fcd4237e9f1f38d"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-d65fb832-5460-495d-9b0c-b8ec70fe9770",
      "chapter_id": "ch-ffc84361-980d-4390-b56c-378db7bafad5",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "sha256": "2d354cc208c312f81f0d4d72c682603571b1edd1bfaf6bcf3561e4e04a22dc6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-e78f6005-6af9-41cb-90a4-785c00cd66f5",
      "chapter_id": "ch-a68dd2df-1049-4654-b6b9-ce617b0f6ac5",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-cba8f8cf-67cc-4251-a178-6ea5e3a5c3cb",
      "chapter_id": "ch-a167a6c7-b814-4bd5-a885-c4bd95684472",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
